ALSO, ALL TIMIDLY, I PAID A

00:09:18.124 --> 00:09:25.064 line:0%
HIGH PRICE TO ADVOCATE --

00:09:23.763 --> 00:09:29.835 line:0%
ADVOCATING FOR ACKNOWLEDGMENT

00:09:25.298 --> 00:09:33.806 line:0%
